OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,FA court has heard Robert Bush
OL,7,Fdefrauded 226 people by charging them
OL,8,Ffor funeral plans he was not
OL,9,Fauthorised to set up, and keeping the
OL,10,Fmoney.
OL,12,FDisgraced funeral director Robert Bush
OL,13,F"used lower prices" to lure customers
OL,14,Fbefore defrauding vulnerable
OL,15,Fpensioners of savings they could not
OL,16,Fafford to lose, a court heard.
OL,26,@uD@AOUuD@SO]
