PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785493110
OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,FBush, 48, is to be sentenced for 67
OL,7,Foffences spanning 12 years and
OL,8,Faffecting hundreds of victims at his
OL,9,Fbusiness, Legacy Independent Funeral
OL,10,FDirectors in Hull.
OL,12,FHull Crown Court has heard Bush
OL,13,Fdefrauded 226 people by charging them
OL,14,Ffor funeral plans he was not
OL,15,Fauthorised to set up, and keeping the
OL,16,Fmoney, which amounted to more than
OL,17,Fhalf a million pounds over almost 12
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785493110
OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,FOn the fourth day of his sentencing
OL,7,Fhearing on Thursday, Bush sat with his
OL,8,Fhead lowered in the dock as victim
OL,9,Fpersonal statements were read by some
OL,10,Fof the people who had lost their money
OL,11,Fto his fraudulent funeral plans.
OL,13,FAnne Hillerby said Bush had charged
OL,14,Fher "around #5,000" for two funeral
OL,15,Fplans but offered to "knock off #100
OL,16,Ffor paying in cash".
OL,18,FHer statement read: "We have since
OL,19,Ffound out the plans are not in place
OL,20,Fand I have not received a refund due
OL,21,Fto paying in cash.
OL,26,@vD@EOUvD@SO]wD@VOUxD@SO]zD@UOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785493110
OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,F"Robert Bush has ripped off so many
OL,7,Fvulnerable people. I can't believe he
OL,8,Fcould do this to people.
OL,10,F"He has used lower prices to get the
OL,11,Fcustomers in then ripped them off."
OL,13,FSeveral victims said they had other
OL,14,Fsavings and the plans had been
OL,15,Fintended as a safety net to save their
OL,16,Fchildren from worrying about their
OL,17,Ffuneral costs.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUsD@cO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
