OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785493110
OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,FJean Hunter said: "That money was a
OL,7,Flot for me, and he knew this because
OL,8,Fhe agreed for me to pay it as and when
OL,9,FI could afford it."
OL,11,FA statement from Alma Hunter said: "It
OL,12,Fis so unfair that I have lost such a
OL,13,Fsubstantial amount of money that I
OL,14,Fcouldn't afford to lose.
OL,16,F"Robert Bush preyed on innocent and
OL,17,Fvulnerable people, devastating lives
OL,18,Fand causing a huge amount of distress,
OL,19,Fnot only to me but to my siblings that
OL,20,Fhe also stole from in a despicable,
OL,21,Fand utterly shameful way."
OL,26,@nD@SOUqD@SO]sD@dOUxD@AOU}D@ZO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/8
