OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,FCarol Grantley said finding out his
OL,7,Ffuneral plan was not valid gave her
OL,8,Funcle "a real fear of dying".
OL,10,FShe said: "Patrick was not a wealthy
OL,11,Fman. He only took the plan out in the
OL,12,Ffirst place because he had come into
OL,13,Fsome extra money from an insurance
OL,14,Fpolicy that had matured, and he
OL,15,Fthought he should cover the cost of
OL,16,Fhis funeral with it before he spent it
OL,17,Fall."
OL,26,@pD@GOUpD@\O]rD@KOUyD@EO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/8
