OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785493110
OL,3,C#5,000 for a bogus funeral plan and
OL,4,Cstill no refund
OL,6,FA court has heard he breached the
OL,7,Ftrust placed in him by grieving
OL,8,Ffamilies "on an almost industrial
OL,9,Fscale", by keeping bodies for months
OL,10,Fafter they should have been cremated,
OL,11,Fgiving out the wrong ashes, taking
OL,12,Fmoney for funeral plans without making
OL,13,Fany of the arrangements, and stealing
OL,14,Fcharity donations collected at
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,FIn April, Bush pleaded guilty to 30
OL,18,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,19,Fdecent burial, and theft from the 12
OL,20,Fcharities.
OL,26,@pD@JOUqD@FO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
